  "body": "Big Land • Nature on Your Doorstep • Endless Potential\r\n\r\nDiscover the potential of 13 Awaruku Road, Torbay — a fantastic opportunity for buyers looking to create their dream home in a peaceful, nature-filled setting.\r\n\r\nSet on a generous section adjoining a beautiful nature trail, this property offers the space, privacy and surroundings that are increasingly hard to find. Whether you’re looking to renovate, modernise, extend or create something truly special, this is a property where your vision can become reality.\r\n\r\nThe existing home provides a great starting point, while the large landholding opens the door to explore a range of possibilities, subject to the necessary council approvals.\r\n\r\nImagine enjoying your morning coffee surrounded by greenery, having a nature trail practically on your doorstep, and coming home to your own private slice of Torbay.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights\r\n• Generous landholding with excellent potential\r\n• Direct connection to a beautiful nature trail\r\n• Existing home ready for your renovation ideas\r\n• Fantastic opportunity for renovators, families and investors\r\n• Peaceful and private setting\r\n• Explore the potential to add value and create your dream home\r\n• Convenient Torbay location close to beaches, local amenities, schools and transport\r\n\r\nBring your imagination, your plans and your vision — this could be your ultimate Torbay do-up!\r\n\r\nContact Anu Jay for viewing times, further information and to discuss the potential this property offers.",
